	Howdy!  I have a weird one for all you hackers:

I played a character named 'yeenhogu' (a whim) and had him level teleport
to 50 (deliberately) without fire resistance, to see if a bones level would
show up.  Sure enough, one did, and when I went down to get it with another
character (a 26th level tourist) I found the level that the first one had
teleported *from*...complete with treasure zoo, fountains, etc.  The down-
staircase didn't function, and when I went up I got a normal-looking maze.

Weird, eh?


